.                 xi: ivreg pricehat mg_cost cost_CO2 i.up if firm_code == `f', cluster(id) 
> noomitted
  5.                 estimates store spec2_`f'
  6.                 
.                 // Seasonality controls
.                 xi: ivreg pricehat mg_cost cost_CO2 summer* spring* winter* weekdays i.up 
> if firm_code == `f', cluster(id) noomitted
  7.                 estimates store spec3_`f'
  8. 
.                 // Instrumented markup estimate
.                 xi: ivreg price mg_cost cost_CO2 (markup = $instruments) summer* spring* w
> inter* weekdays i.up if firm_code == `f', cluster(id) noomitted 
